WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.980
<b>Farsas Castle    Oscar's Residence</b>

00:07.130 --> 00:09.860
Erase the words to be 
torn asunder at the root.

00:10.260 --> 00:13.250
Rid all meaning from the 
rain that takes shape.

00:13.940 --> 00:16.180
Let all cycles return as cycles.

00:17.110 --> 00:20.970
Abide by my laws, all that may arise.

00:27.430 --> 00:28.770
Are you done?

00:28.770 --> 00:29.470
Yes.

00:29.940 --> 00:34.380
This should negate all external attacks, 
be they physical or magical.

00:35.070 --> 00:39.390
As long as I remain alive, 
no other human can break this spell.

00:39.830 --> 00:42.370
Sounds like practically cheating.

00:42.370 --> 00:44.160
You made a contract with a witch.

00:44.160 --> 00:45.820
This is the least I could do.

00:46.290 --> 00:51.140
That said, you're still vulnerable 
to poison and psychological attacks.

00:51.770 --> 00:53.370
So do be careful.

00:54.190 --> 00:56.580
Not too shabby for an apprentice mage.

00:57.490 --> 00:59.990
That's my cover story within the palace.

01:00.460 --> 01:05.710
However, I left the tower to lift 
your curse, as your protector.

01:06.270 --> 01:07.960
Don't forget that.

01:08.240 --> 01:12.050
All I want is for you to marry me.

01:13.220 --> 01:15.950
You know I said "no," right?

02:47.180 --> 02:52.020
~ The Past Recalled Once Again ~

02:53.450 --> 02:56.390
Finding a successor sounds 
like a real problem.

02:56.730 --> 03:00.740
Isn't there anyone else 
who's part of the royal bloodline?

03:01.170 --> 03:03.850
I seem to recall there 
being a few branch families.

03:04.370 --> 03:06.020
About fifteen years ago,

03:06.020 --> 03:10.150
there was a series of cases where babies 
disappeared around the kingdom.

03:11.090 --> 03:13.580
Fifteen years ago, you say...

03:13.580 --> 03:19.300
It was then that His Highness's 
cousins all went missing.

03:19.790 --> 03:24.350
As a result, there aren't any royals left 
who are younger than he is.

03:29.430 --> 03:30.710
There.

03:29.430 --> 03:32.390
<b>Kav     Farsas Mage</b>

03:31.290 --> 03:33.400
Sylvia, how are you faring?

03:33.400 --> 03:36.360
<b>Sylvia     Farsas Mage</b>

03:35.110 --> 03:37.930
I've almost got it.

03:48.250 --> 03:49.180
What?

03:51.800 --> 03:52.920
Are you okay?

03:52.920 --> 03:54.500
Yeah.

03:54.500 --> 03:56.770
She did that without an incantation?

03:57.500 --> 03:58.770
That's...

03:59.020 --> 04:01.720
Miss Tinasha, was it?

04:01.720 --> 04:02.670
Yeah.

04:03.310 --> 04:06.250
His Highness brought her 
from the witch's tower.

04:06.250 --> 04:07.370
Witch's tower?

04:07.770 --> 04:08.990
Huh...

04:09.950 --> 04:11.930
Sorry to interrupt your rest.

04:12.350 --> 04:14.020
You really helped me out.

04:14.650 --> 04:16.360
Pay it no mind.

04:16.360 --> 04:18.060
I'm always happy to do this much.

04:25.060 --> 04:26.910
A sparring match?

04:27.180 --> 04:29.950
General Als and Meredina, looks like.

04:32.870 --> 04:34.790
He's quite the fighter.

04:35.040 --> 04:39.140
He's one of the younger generals, 
but the most skilled of them all.

04:39.800 --> 04:43.220
Though His Highness is 
stronger than General Als.

04:43.530 --> 04:44.680
Ugh...

04:45.210 --> 04:47.300
What's with that reaction?

04:47.830 --> 04:49.640
Oh, don't mind me.

04:51.890 --> 04:54.150
No wonder he conquered the tower.

04:56.810 --> 04:58.110
Where are you going?

04:58.110 --> 05:01.760
Some sword practice sounds nice 
about now, after so long.

05:01.760 --> 05:02.810
I see.

05:03.510 --> 05:04.360
What?

05:12.540 --> 05:13.700
Let's go again.

05:22.270 --> 05:24.870
You seem too good to be just a dabbler.

05:25.620 --> 05:29.940
If you joined us instead of being a mage, 
you'd fit in just fine.

05:31.210 --> 05:32.630
Thanks for the kind words.

05:35.430 --> 05:37.190
Well? How was she?

05:37.510 --> 05:39.500
You saw for yourself.

05:38.850 --> 05:41.820
<b>Meredina     Farsas Officer                                           Als      Farsas General{right}</b>

05:39.500 --> 05:43.400
She's obviously more than just 
His Highness's prize pet.

05:43.980 --> 05:46.360
I heard she's the pupil of a witch.

05:46.740 --> 05:47.940
Is this really okay?

05:48.760 --> 05:51.950
Jealousy doesn't suit you, Meredina.

05:53.860 --> 05:55.910
Ow, ow, ow!

06:00.610 --> 06:01.530
Master.

06:04.580 --> 06:06.760
Litola. You were here?

06:07.060 --> 06:08.900
I'm glad to see you're well.

06:09.480 --> 06:11.930
You've found a fine individual, it seems.

06:12.310 --> 06:13.640
You think?

06:13.640 --> 06:16.340
You seem to be enjoying 
yourself much more now.

06:17.270 --> 06:19.780
I guess you could say that...

06:22.530 --> 06:24.490
Well, it's not bad.

06:25.820 --> 06:26.740
So?

06:26.740 --> 06:27.440
Yes.

06:27.890 --> 06:30.810
There's something I thought you should know.

06:35.260 --> 06:36.420
Is that you, Tinasha?

06:36.420 --> 06:38.850
Did you get a good work...

06:39.250 --> 06:40.020
out...

06:41.140 --> 06:42.500
What happened?

06:42.500 --> 06:44.020
Why are you dressed like that?

06:44.740 --> 06:46.880
I'll be leaving for two or three days.

06:46.880 --> 06:48.050
Hold on, now.

06:48.050 --> 06:49.090
Where are you going?

06:49.090 --> 06:51.140
I'm free to go where I want.

06:51.140 --> 06:52.800
I'll make sure I come back.

06:52.800 --> 06:54.580
I formed a contract with you.

06:54.580 --> 06:56.560
I can't have you leaving at any time.

06:56.560 --> 06:59.270
At least tell me where you're headed.

07:04.940 --> 07:06.960
The magical lake in Druza.

07:06.960 --> 07:08.110
The magical lake?!

07:08.590 --> 07:09.620
That's dangerous!

07:09.620 --> 07:13.320
That's where the demonic beast 
was sealed away seventy years ago!

07:17.210 --> 07:20.410
There are large surges of 
high magical power occurring there.

07:20.410 --> 07:24.750
I'm off to find out who's responsible 
and what they're plotting.

07:25.190 --> 07:26.710
In that case, I'll join you.

07:26.960 --> 07:28.660
That won't be necessary.

07:28.660 --> 07:30.720
The crown prince shouldn't venture out, anyway.

07:31.070 --> 07:33.800
That land is effectively 
under Farsas jurisdiction.

07:33.800 --> 07:37.180
Even with my word, the state won't 
take kindly to you investigating alone.

07:37.670 --> 07:41.390
If the two of us go, it might 
become an even bigger problem.

07:41.690 --> 07:43.230
I'll gather able soldiers.

07:43.230 --> 07:46.060
I'm not obligated to protect 
anyone other than you.

07:46.060 --> 07:47.450
I'm well aware.

07:52.540 --> 07:54.050
One hour.

07:54.050 --> 07:55.750
I won't wait any longer.

08:07.270 --> 08:10.510
What do you expect to find out here, Valt?

08:10.510 --> 08:13.390
Nothing visible to the naked eye.

08:13.390 --> 08:15.670
But it's about to begin.

08:16.410 --> 08:18.680
She should take notice pretty soon.

08:19.010 --> 08:21.210
The Witch of the Azure Moon?

08:21.210 --> 08:25.040
Will she really come all this way?

08:25.040 --> 08:25.890
Yes, she will.

08:27.330 --> 08:30.610
She has eyes all across the mainland.

08:31.010 --> 08:34.270
After all, she's looking for him as well.

08:41.290 --> 08:43.250
Is everyone ready?

08:47.740 --> 08:51.130
Is that a dragon you have on your shoulder?

08:51.400 --> 08:52.240
What?

08:52.240 --> 08:54.090
My name is Sylvia.

08:54.410 --> 08:57.080
We haven't spoken, have we?

08:57.080 --> 08:58.130
It's a pleasure!

08:58.570 --> 08:59.870
Y-Yes.

09:01.060 --> 09:03.020
How amazing.

09:03.020 --> 09:04.520
It's my first time seeing one!

09:04.830 --> 09:08.110
Th... There, there...

09:09.690 --> 09:11.700
I-I'm sorry!

09:11.700 --> 09:15.010
It's not used to people, so please be careful.

09:15.680 --> 09:16.610
Tinasha.

09:17.310 --> 09:18.800
What's that thing?

09:18.800 --> 09:21.520
I was going to ride it if I was going alone.

09:21.520 --> 09:23.830
It doesn't look big enough to ride.

09:24.970 --> 09:27.540
We're embarking on a survey 
of the magical lake in Druza.

09:27.540 --> 09:29.670
We don't know 
what we'll find, so stay vigilant.

09:30.610 --> 09:34.030
Also, don't go against her orders.

09:35.340 --> 09:37.690
Is it really okay to say that?

09:37.690 --> 09:38.350
Yeah.

09:40.490 --> 09:42.700
You really are a strange man.

09:43.850 --> 09:45.580
It's fine.

09:45.580 --> 09:47.060
I'll take care of it.

09:48.090 --> 09:48.820
Let's go!

09:48.820 --> 09:50.140
<i>Off we go, Tinasha.</i>

09:59.360 --> 10:01.140
<i>Like dust in the wind,</i>

10:01.770 --> 10:04.080
<i>no one back then is still alive.</i>

10:04.570 --> 10:09.060
<i>And so, everything I know leaves me behind.</i>

10:10.130 --> 10:13.620
<i>Still, I remain in the same place.</i>

10:14.460 --> 10:17.740
<i>This is the path I chose for myself.</i>

10:18.490 --> 10:19.930
Let's go, Tinasha.

10:20.420 --> 10:22.390
Hey, what's wrong?

10:26.500 --> 10:27.810
Is something the matter?

10:29.570 --> 10:31.150
No, it's nothing.

10:42.030 --> 10:44.990
<b>Ynureid Fortress    Northwestern Farsas, Bordering Druza</b>

10:44.990 --> 10:46.930
Your Highness, look at that.

10:46.930 --> 10:47.700
Yeah.

10:48.500 --> 10:49.380
Let's go!

10:49.900 --> 10:50.610
Yes!

10:52.380 --> 10:56.900
<i>Seventy years ago, the neighboring 
nation of Druza invaded Farsas.</i>

10:57.380 --> 11:01.800
<i>As Farsas drove back the enemy 
with a steady army,</i>

11:01.800 --> 11:05.430
<i>Druza unleashed their giant 
magic weapon, a demonic beast.</i>

11:06.260 --> 11:09.370
<i>The beast, not fully 
under control, was let loose,</i>

11:09.370 --> 11:13.090
<i>laying waste to foes, 
allies, and the land itself.</i>

11:13.670 --> 11:17.940
<i>Ultimately, the beast was sealed away 
by the Witch of the Azure Moon,</i>

11:17.940 --> 11:20.340
<i>but its miasma poisoned the earth,</i>

11:20.340 --> 11:23.690
<i>turning it into a barren 
wasteland devoid of any life.</i>

11:25.490 --> 11:26.950
What a sight to behold.

11:27.260 --> 11:28.570
It's a nightmare come to life.

11:29.060 --> 11:31.390
This is where that demonic beast is sealed?

11:31.830 --> 11:33.680
It was a formidable opponent.

11:33.680 --> 11:37.300
With humans in the area, it was 
all I could do to seal it away.

11:37.680 --> 11:40.380
If I had kept on fighting back then,

11:40.380 --> 11:43.260
the outcome would have 
been much more gruesome.

11:45.130 --> 11:46.100
Tinasha?

11:46.690 --> 11:48.490
I know you're there.

11:48.490 --> 11:50.060
Stop hiding and show yourself.

11:53.460 --> 11:55.560
Long time no see.

11:55.560 --> 11:57.020
You're...

11:57.020 --> 12:01.490
I didn't think I'd live to see you again.

11:57.980 --> 12:00.940
<b>Druza Mage</b>

12:01.490 --> 12:04.290
Your dress, your beauty...

12:04.300 --> 12:07.950
It's like I've been 
transported back seventy years,

12:07.950 --> 12:10.910
Miss Witch of the Azure Moon.

12:11.270 --> 12:11.980
A witch?!

12:11.980 --> 12:13.370
Miss Tinasha?

12:13.370 --> 12:17.030
And you've grown quite old yourself.

12:17.030 --> 12:19.340
Or should I say you've shriveled up?

12:19.730 --> 12:22.300
Back then, you were just a child.

12:22.300 --> 12:27.000
I would normally have been long dead by now.

12:27.000 --> 12:31.080
You see, we're not all like you.

12:31.080 --> 12:34.730
I see you've taken after your master 
in the way you look and talk.

12:34.730 --> 12:38.800
You mean the master who you beheaded?

12:38.800 --> 12:41.690
I'm very pleased to hear that.

12:42.260 --> 12:43.900
I'll do you a favor, then.

12:44.550 --> 12:46.780
You can share the same fate.

12:47.550 --> 12:49.730
Oh, how terrifying.

12:49.730 --> 12:55.290
I'm not powerful enough to 
handle you, so I'll take my leave.

12:55.290 --> 12:59.610
I suggest that all of you 
depart this place, too.

12:59.610 --> 13:05.180
Or perhaps you need to be 
convinced with a death or two.

13:06.130 --> 13:06.760
Stand back!

13:16.540 --> 13:17.230
Why, you!

13:20.190 --> 13:21.070
Your Highness!

13:32.260 --> 13:33.230
Are you okay?

13:33.980 --> 13:35.060
Yes.

13:35.060 --> 13:36.080
Tinasha.

13:36.420 --> 13:37.770
He got away.

13:37.770 --> 13:38.930
You know him?

13:40.110 --> 13:44.590
He was one of Druza's mages 
controlling the beast.

13:44.590 --> 13:47.450
So that surge of magical power...

13:47.760 --> 13:52.220
Most likely, it's the result 
of trying to revive the beast.

13:52.220 --> 13:55.020
Revenge after seventy years, huh?

13:55.020 --> 13:56.060
I believe so.

13:57.770 --> 13:59.190
Some first-aid treatment.

14:00.100 --> 14:02.900
Miss Tinasha, you're a witch?

14:04.810 --> 14:08.480
By the way, did you let your arm 
take the hit on purpose?

14:08.480 --> 14:09.910
Attacks don't affect me, do they?

14:19.990 --> 14:21.840
I'm sorry I kept it a secret.

14:22.470 --> 14:24.670
I didn't want to startle anyone.

14:25.000 --> 14:26.880
That's not it! I...

14:30.230 --> 14:31.300
You mustn't.

14:31.900 --> 14:34.310
Witches are objects of fear.

14:34.970 --> 14:36.270
Don't feel bad.

14:38.860 --> 14:40.490
Let's retreat for now.

14:40.490 --> 14:42.570
We'll gather forces and arm ourselves.

14:42.570 --> 14:44.900
I'll go after that mage.

14:44.900 --> 14:46.190
You can't be serious.

14:46.450 --> 14:51.430
Now that we're onto them, they'll try to 
undo the seal as fast as they can.

14:55.010 --> 14:56.160
I'm coming with you.

14:56.160 --> 14:57.750
Again?

14:58.330 --> 15:03.080
I know you're very capable, 
and I admire your willingness.

15:03.670 --> 15:08.050
But if you're going to become king, 
you need to learn to delegate.

15:08.050 --> 15:09.570
I understand.

15:09.570 --> 15:11.010
But not now.

15:11.310 --> 15:14.220
I won't have you do all the dirty work for me.

15:14.220 --> 15:17.220
Isn't that why you dragged me out of my tower?

15:17.530 --> 15:18.580
No.

15:18.580 --> 15:20.940
Their target is Farsas.

15:20.940 --> 15:23.310
I can't have you bear that burden alone.

15:25.610 --> 15:27.020
I swear.

15:27.020 --> 15:29.150
You really are so stubborn.

15:29.790 --> 15:32.380
Our contract is only for one year.

15:32.380 --> 15:34.870
Feel free to have me solve 
your troubles while I'm here.

15:35.340 --> 15:36.710
Tinasha.

15:36.710 --> 15:41.580
Besides, the weight of your 
burdens is nothing to me.

15:42.090 --> 15:43.410
Oscar.

15:43.410 --> 15:48.300
You and I are bound by our contract, 
and as long as I am your protector,

15:48.300 --> 15:53.300
I will always return to you, 
no matter what I do or where I go.

15:54.130 --> 15:56.570
And I won't die before you do.

15:57.450 --> 15:58.520
That's for certain.

16:00.910 --> 16:03.180
I understand. Go on.

16:03.180 --> 16:03.860
Yes.

16:06.220 --> 16:07.020
Nark.

16:12.750 --> 16:15.370
Tinasha, when you come back...

16:15.370 --> 16:16.570
Yeah?

16:17.450 --> 16:18.950
We should get married.

16:18.950 --> 16:20.280
N-Not happening!

16:20.280 --> 16:22.430
Don't jinx yourself like that!

16:28.090 --> 16:31.050
Hurry and break the final seal!

16:31.050 --> 16:32.260
We don't have time!

16:32.260 --> 16:35.220
The control spell isn't fully ready yet!

16:35.220 --> 16:36.700
I don't care!

16:36.700 --> 16:38.420
The witch found us!

16:38.420 --> 16:39.410
The witch?!

16:39.410 --> 16:40.140
No way...

16:40.140 --> 16:41.060
Hurry!

16:41.060 --> 16:45.230
Break the seal on the beast 
before they storm in here!

16:45.230 --> 16:48.090
Begone, definiens!

16:49.690 --> 16:51.450
It's not too late.

16:51.450 --> 16:56.870
I'll make sure power is restored to Druza, 
with help from the demonic beast!

16:57.240 --> 17:00.860
I won't let it end 
now that we've come this far!

17:11.750 --> 17:13.830
Looks like I missed one.

17:15.990 --> 17:17.240
What's wrong?

17:17.240 --> 17:19.110
You want to undo the seal?

17:21.310 --> 17:22.970
I'll break it for you, then.

17:23.350 --> 17:26.140
As it stands, I can't lay 
a finger on it, either.

17:26.770 --> 17:28.900
Sing for me, ancient forewarning.

17:29.230 --> 17:33.400
Chains born in days bygone, 
crumble by my command.

17:48.670 --> 17:49.890
It's dangerous.

17:49.890 --> 17:51.430
Stay away until it's all over.

17:58.790 --> 18:00.970
It's been seventy years.

18:01.340 --> 18:03.170
Did you have a pleasant slumber?

18:15.790 --> 18:17.820
That's one bushy mane.

18:23.910 --> 18:25.580
Brim forth, my definition!

18:36.590 --> 18:37.590
Burst!

18:48.390 --> 18:50.970
<i>It heals as fast as ever.</i>

18:50.970 --> 18:51.860
<i>However...</i>

18:52.150 --> 18:53.500
Rise up.

18:53.500 --> 18:56.320
The cage that confines you 
hides yet in darkness.

18:56.700 --> 18:59.950
Your view shows naught 
but these seven shackles.

19:00.450 --> 19:02.660
Tranquility is blind without meaning.

19:03.110 --> 19:05.820
Slumber in the cave of ignorance you rejected.

19:06.850 --> 19:09.370
Sorry, but this time, you must die.

19:09.820 --> 19:12.790
You have nothing to gain from living here.

19:13.890 --> 19:16.270
Recognize my will as command.

19:16.790 --> 19:19.390
Silence brimming in ubiquity.

19:19.860 --> 19:22.710
You hold no power without my words.

19:22.710 --> 19:25.450
Define the light that extinguishes.

19:32.770 --> 19:33.860
This is the end!

19:51.020 --> 19:52.120
Tinasha?

19:53.500 --> 19:55.080
Someone call for a mage!

20:06.370 --> 20:07.100
You may enter.

20:08.130 --> 20:09.270
Pardon me.

20:09.740 --> 20:10.970
How's Tinasha?

20:10.970 --> 20:12.980
I've performed a full body examination.

20:13.380 --> 20:15.400
I couldn't find any severe wounds.

20:15.690 --> 20:17.470
No wounds?

20:17.470 --> 20:19.290
What about her stomach?

20:19.290 --> 20:21.660
It looks like she patched herself up.

20:21.660 --> 20:24.760
I can't tell how it looks on the inside.

20:24.760 --> 20:25.660
I see.

20:26.690 --> 20:28.890
Can I go check up on her?

20:28.890 --> 20:29.820
Go ahead.

20:29.820 --> 20:33.850
I can't imagine she'll come to until she's 
recovered her magical power, though.

20:42.570 --> 20:43.840
Tinasha. Are you awak—

20:50.450 --> 20:51.630
Tinasha?

20:54.330 --> 20:57.150
Don't come in while I'm naked!

20:59.570 --> 21:02.060
I had suffered severe organ damage,

21:02.060 --> 21:05.280
so I recovered by accelerating 
my bodily growth.

21:05.280 --> 21:07.220
Organ damage?

21:07.220 --> 21:08.490
Are you okay?

21:08.490 --> 21:09.740
I'm all better now.

21:10.230 --> 21:12.900
Just a little anemic from all the bleeding.

21:13.550 --> 21:15.450
Will your appearance change back?

21:15.890 --> 21:17.410
No, it won't.

21:17.410 --> 21:21.210
My appearance was due to halting my growth.

21:22.700 --> 21:25.430
You really defeated the demonic beast, huh?

21:25.860 --> 21:26.760
Piece of cake.

21:26.760 --> 21:28.850
What about that deadly injury?

21:32.770 --> 21:33.950
You saved us.

21:34.700 --> 21:37.130
Your actions meant no one else was harmed.

21:38.590 --> 21:39.510
Thank you.

21:41.710 --> 21:43.900
This is the least I could do.

21:44.990 --> 21:46.450
I'm a witch, after all.

23:35.470 --> 23:40.020
~ What the Forest Dreams Of ~
